                                "sense_id": "47eca8d6-62a0-3b0d-a871-81f7ec72a5d0",
                                "text": "After a scare like that, you might need to change your shorts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b63f5ed-7385-4e0e-833f-3348ddadb335",
                                "sense_id": "47eca8d6-62a0-3b0d-a871-81f7ec72a5d0",
                                "text": "And always, when the food arrives, send something back. It's considered very sophisticated. But make sure you use colorful language. Tell him, \"Waiter, this veal tastes like the inside front panel of Ferdinand Magellan's shorts. And I'm referring to the first voyage.\""
                            }
